$NetBSD: patch-configure,v 1.4 2024/12/24 10:13:40 wiz Exp $

Chunks 1, 4, 5: Changes for consistency across pkgsrc platforms.
Chunk 1: Simplify _sysconfigdata to include only platform name; and give the
         build host's python only it from the build directory (.sysconfigdata,
         see the Makefile): with all of it, it took the new modules for its own.
Chunk 2: Disable barrier to cross-compilation.
Chunk 3: should be handled in the Makefile?
Chunk 6: ?
IRIX: build libpython as a shared library, as on the BSDs.

